{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22427","headline":"早蝉 · 白居易","name":"早蝉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六月初七日，江头蝉始鸣。\n石楠深叶里，薄暮两三声。\n一催衰鬓色，再动故园情。\n西风殊未起，秋思先秋生。\n忆昔在东掖，宫槐花下听。\n今朝无限思，云树绕湓城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}